</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white">If
an emerging growth company that prepares its financial statements in accordance with U.S. GAAP, indicate by check mark if the registrant
has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant
to Section 13(a) Exchange Act. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" format="ixt:fixed-true" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#9746;</span></ix:nonNumeric></p><div>

