</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">General and administrative
expenses increased by $0.05 million, or 7%, to $0.83 million for the year ended December 31, 2022, from $0.78 million in 2021. The increase
was primarily due to salaries and related expenses.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">General and administrative
expenses increased by $0.1 million, or 15%, to $0.8 million for the year ended December 31, 2021, from $0.7 million in 2020. The increase
was primarily due to IPO related service providers.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

