    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt"><a href="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1899005/000121390023018552/ea174872ex99-1_beamrimag.htm">Amended and Restated Articles of Association of the Registrant (filed as Exhibit 99.1 to our Report on Form 6-K as filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on March 8, 2023, and incorporated herein by reference)</a></span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: White">
