<td style="width: 0%"></td><td style="width: 0.5in">A.</td><td style="text-align: justify">Lease commitments</td></tr></table><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 39.3pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

