compensation expense related to unvested share options. The Company recognizes compensation expense on a straight-line basis over the
requisite service periods, which results in a weighted average period of approximately <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:NetAmountAtRiskByProductAndGuaranteeWeightedAveragePeriodRemaining1">1.72</ix:nonNumeric> years over which the unrecognized compensation
expense is expected to be recognized.</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

