<td style="width: 0%"></td><td style="width: 0.5in"><b>C.</b></td><td style="text-align: justify">Taxes on income are comprised from taxes incurred as result of (i) withholding tax deducted at source
in accordance with U.S. - Israel tax treaty related to selling of software and (ii) implementation of the intercompany agreement between
the Company and&#160;Beamr Inc. for conducting reseller services and implementation of the intercompany agreement between the Company
and Beamr Imaging RU for conducting research and development services on behalf of the Company (see also Note 1B).</td></tr></table><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 28.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -28.35pt"><b>&#160;</b></p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

