<td style="width: 0%"></td><td style="width: 0.5in"><b>D.</b></td><td style="text-align: justify">Loss (income) before taxes on income consists of the following:</td></tr></table><p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

