<td style="width: 0%"></td><td style="width: 0.5in"><b>A.</b></td><td style="text-align: justify"><b>General information</b></td></tr></table><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 28.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -28.35pt"><b>&#160;</b></p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_3" id="_SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_2"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">Since inception date, the operation
of the Company is conducted through <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:NumberOfOperatingSegments" scale="0" unitRef="Segment">one</ix:nonFraction> operating segment, the optimization technology for video and photo compression, which represents
a single reporting unit. This activity also represents the reportable segment of the Group.</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 28.35pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

