<td style="width: 0%"></td><td style="width: 0.5in"><b>B.</b></td><td style="text-align: justify"><b>Revenues by geographic region are as follows:</b></td></tr></table><p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

